Modifications:
- Rust translation with dependency-free bounded finite source-grid kernels.
- User-observed pixel half-width, no eye/face scale or inferred neck contour.
- Square separable closing/max footprints instead of upstream ellipse closing.
- Full composed dependency erosion of independently owned skin/protection.
- No adaptive masked blur, chroma borrowing, reduced-grid solve or RGB patch.
- Positive scalar log gain, 6 L* lift and 1.25x gain caps; current linear-RGB
  headroom through a common gain without independent channel clipping.
- Explicit memory admission, checked C ABI, cancellable private calculation,
  immutable Python evidence, no runtime compilation or alternate algorithm.
- All runtime, numerical and representative-photo acceptance remains UNRUN.

